      "content": "wait, what? i dont get what you mean by goblins. can we just focus on the technical stuff? \n\nthe ConnectionError is definitely weird because it's only happening during spikes. do you think it's a socket exhaustion issue or just the upstream provider dropping connections? also, what's the deal with that NameError? it's in the error handler itself which is super frustrating.",
